api.minimax.io (MiniMax API, Open Platform)

  Provides       The language-model answer for every intent this miner serves.
                 SENTIMENT_ANALYSIS, TEXT_CLASSIFICATION, LANGUAGE_GENERATION and
                 LANGUAGE_TRANSLATION are each answered by one call to MiniMax-M3 at
                 request time.
  Plan           A paid commercial MiniMax plan held by the operator. The API key is
                 a Cloudflare secret set with `wrangler secret put MINIMAX_API_KEY`
                 and read as env.MINIMAX_API_KEY. It is never in the code or the repo.
  Output rights  MiniMax's consumer App and Web Terms of Service state "We do not
                 claim ownership of User Contributions or User Generated Content" but
                 limit that consumer surface to "personal, non-commercial use only".
                 Those consumer terms do not govern the paid API Open Platform this
                 miner calls. The exact Open Platform clause on output ownership and
                 commercial use could not be read, because the platform terms page is
                 client-rendered and returned no text to a server fetch (404 to a
                 server fetch on 2026-10-01), so it is recorded as unverified and
                 carried as an open item in DATA-SOURCES.md.
  Credit         Published in every answer, in the attribution field: "Answer produced
                 with MiniMax (MiniMax-M3) under a commercial MiniMax plan held by
                 zkasuran."
  Terms          https://platform.minimax.io/protocol/en-US/user-agreement (unverified,
                 client-rendered)
